module average
edition 0
needs console


note: The mean of a list of numbers.
    example: average of [1, 2, 3] gives 2
    example: average of [] fails with empty-list
to average of numbers (a list of numbers) giving a number, may fail with empty-list:
    if numbers is empty:
        give back problem empty-list
    give back (sum of numbers) / (count of numbers)


to report of numbers (a list of numbers) giving a text, may fail with empty-list:
    let mean be try average of numbers
    give back "mean {mean}"


to main, needs console:
    show average of [2, 4, 9]
    show report of [1, 2]
    let missing be report of []
    show missing's kind
